@startuml US2.2.4 - System Sequence Diagram

actor "Port Authority Officer" as Officer
participant "Port System" as System

' --- Create storage area ---
activate Officer
Officer -> System : Request to create storage area
activate System
alt Valid data
  System --> Officer : Storage area created
else Invalid or missing data
  System --> Officer : Show validation errors
end
deactivate System

' --- Update storage area ---
Officer -> System : Request to update storage area
activate System

alt New maxCapacityTEU < currentOccupancy
  System --> Officer : Reject update with reason
else Valid update
  System --> Officer : Update successful
end
deactivate System

' --- Search & filter ---
Officer -> System : Apply search/filter
activate System
System --> Officer : Display filtered list of storage areas
deactivate System

' --- View details ---
Officer -> System : Select storage area to view details
activate System
alt Yard constrained to specific docks
  System --> Officer : Show details with
else Warehouse or yard serving whole port
  System --> Officer : Show details with
end
deactivate System
deactivate Officer

@enduml
